<title>SINGAPORE: ST Shipbuilding 1996 net up 13 pct.</title>
<headline>ST Shipbuilding 1996 net up 13 pct.</headline>
<dateline>SINGAPORE 1997-03-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>Full year to December 31, 1996</p>
<p>	   (in millions of Singapore dollars unless stated)</p>
<p>    Net profit		     43.27	vs	38.39</p>
<p>    Group shr (cts)		22.2	 vs	19.7</p>
<p>    Group shr fully dil. (cts) 21.9	 vs	19.5</p>
<p>    Dividend (pct)		 20.00	vs	15.00</p>
<p>    Turnover			349.96	vs     219.64</p>
<p>    Investment income	     9.40	vs	 6.14</p>
<p>    Other income incl int.     10.61	vs	 8.32</p>
<p>    Depreciation/amortisation  11.40	vs	10.61</p>
<p>    Pre-tax profit		 58.19	vs	54.54</p>
<p>    Profit from associates	0.18	vs	 0.12 (loss)</p>
<p>    Tax				15.11	vs	16.04</p>
<p>Note - Full name is Singapore Technologies Shipbuilding &amp; Engineering Ltd.</p>
<p>-- Singapore newsroom (65 8703083)</p>
